gin":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-12T14:08:57Z","updated_at":"2025-10-12T14:08:57Z","body":"> Doesn't the `Transform2D.looking_at()` method make more sense in this context?\r\n\r\nI guess it really depends what one wants to do/achieve. Since `Node2D.look_at` expects `some_global_position` as its parameter, you'd need to do something like `node2d.global_transform.looking_at(some_global_position)` as the equivalent (or `node2d.transform.looking_at(some_parent_space_position)`). And then do something with the result. Seems a little more complicated to me (or rather easier to use incorrectly) than using `Node2D.get_angle_to` which allows to obtain a value directly applicable to `Node2D.rotation`.\r\n\r\nNevertheless, I would say it shouldn't hurt to add a note like `See also: [Transform2D.looking_at]`. However, looking at `Transform2D.looking_at` implementation it doesn't actually do the same thing as `Node2D.look_at`, seems there are some scaling issues with it: #57998, #74966. So, at least for now, I conclude it's better to not add such link.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3394503967/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3399534821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111139#issuecomment-3399534821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111139","id":3399534821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KoMjl","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T00:35:42Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T00:35:42Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3399534821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]